cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite this software repository and the companion manuscript when published."
type: software
title: "TLE Mature Oligodendrocyte P5: donor-aware analysis scripts"
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Difei
version: 1.0.1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Difei1993/TLE-Mature-Oligodendrocyte-P5"
abstract: >-
  Author-written analysis and figure scripts supporting a donor-aware
  characterization of a mature oligodendrocyte P5 transcriptional program
  in human temporal lobe epilepsy. This code-only repository does not
  redistribute third-party source datasets or frozen input artifacts.
  The software includes three display-only helpers for Supplementary Figures
  S3-S5 that reuse archived plots, saved coordinates and frozen tables.
  Full end-to-end scientific reproduction has not been tested.
keywords:
  - temporal lobe epilepsy
  - mature oligodendrocyte
  - transcriptomics
  - donor-aware analysis
  - bioinformatics
